1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,999
WARNING

2
00:00:01,999 --> 00:00:04,125
IT FELT SO UNFAIR.

3
00:00:04,125 --> 00:00:08,423
ONE FLEETING MOMENT, AND MISFORTUNE
SWALLOWED ME WHOLE.

4
00:00:08,423 --> 00:00:10,584
YET, AGAIN AND AGAIN…

6
00:00:12,584 --> 00:00:14,584
HUU

7
00:00:14,584 --> 00:00:18,961
...I'M MADE TO FEEL AS IF I WAS BORN ONLY
TO SUFFER.

8
00:00:18,961 --> 00:00:20,961
HAA...

9
00:00:20,961 --> 00:00:22,961
HAA…

10
00:00:22,961 --> 00:00:25,490
...THE WIND STIRS...

12
00:00:27,490 --> 00:00:29,557
...THE FLOWERS BLOOM...

14
00:00:31,557 --> 00:00:35,764
...MIGHT BE NOTHING MORE THAN RUINS.

15
00:00:35,764 --> 00:00:37,764
Dirty Deeds

17
00:00:39,764 --> 00:00:41,764
MAKE SURE EVERYTHING'S READY.

18
00:00:41,764 --> 00:00:43,763
DING-A-LING

19
00:00:43,763 --> 00:00:47,085
MS. CHEON'S USUALLY THE ONE TENDING
YEONGHWADANG...

20
00:00:47,085 --> 00:00:50,264
WHO'D HAVE THOUGHT SHE WOULD FALL SICK
TODAY OF ALL DAYS?

21
00:00:50,264 --> 00:00:52,265
CLACK

22
00:00:52,265 --> 00:00:56,039
IT'S BEEN WHAT, NINE YEARS SINCE THIS
ANNEX WAS LAST USED?

23
00:00:56,039 --> 00:00:58,736
JUST A WEEK AGO, THIS WAS STILL MY STUDIO.

24
00:00:58,736 --> 00:01:00,737
SIT

25
00:01:00,737 --> 00:01:03,199
THERE'S STILL SOME TIME BEFORE NIGHTFALL.

26
00:01:03,199 --> 00:01:05,199
LONG TIME NO SEE, MAN!

27
00:01:05,199 --> 00:01:08,374
YEAH, IT'S BEEN A WHILE. CAME TO SEE YOUR
PARENTS, HUH?

28
00:01:08,374 --> 00:01:11,308
THE WHOLE MARRIAGE TALK IS KILLING ME.

29
00:01:11,308 --> 00:01:13,307
ME?

30
00:01:13,307 --> 00:01:15,308
I WAS SUPPOSED TO TELL YOU THIS...

31
00:01:15,308 --> 00:01:17,307
I might...

32
00:01:17,307 --> 00:01:23,837
WAIT, YOU'RE DATING THAT SAHUI YEON?!

33
00:01:23,837 --> 00:01:25,838
NOT EXACTLY DATING...

34
00:01:25,838 --> 00:01:28,054
SHE STILL STUPIDLY HOT OR WHAT?

35
00:01:28,054 --> 00:01:30,054
OBVIOUS?

36
00:01:30,054 --> 00:01:32,888
SHE'S DAMAGED GOODS, AFTER ALL.

37
00:01:32,888 --> 00:01:34,937
SERIOUSLY, WHAT ELSE DOES SHE HAVE?

38
00:01:34,937 --> 00:01:36,937
DOES SHE HAVE BESIDES HER BODY?

39
00:01:36,937 --> 00:01:39,417
WHY AM I EVEN LISTENING TO THIS GARBAGE?

40
00:01:39,417 --> 00:01:41,416
LIMP

41
00:01:41,416 --> 00:01:43,416
I'D BETTER CLOSE IT OFF MYSELF.

42
00:01:43,416 --> 00:01:45,417
...ARRIVES.

45
00:01:49,417 --> 00:01:51,416
BUT YOU THINK YOU COULD EVEN SLEEP WITH
HER?

46
00:01:51,416 --> 00:01:54,135
ISN'T SHE, LIKE, PARALYZED FROM THE WAIST
DOWN?

47
00:01:54,135 --> 00:01:58,309
THE HELL ARE YOU TALKING ABOUT? IT'S JUST
HER ANKLE. THE REST WORKS FINE.

48
00:01:58,309 --> 00:02:00,310
OH?

49
00:02:00,310 --> 00:02:03,009
DAMN, I'M JEALOUS, MAN! SHE'S GOT A GREAT
RACK.

50
00:02:03,009 --> 00:02:05,700
I'LL LET YOU KNOW HOW IT IS AFTER I TRY
HER OUT.
